cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization audit, please cite this repository and, when relevant, the underlying manuscript bundle and Mathlib separately."
title: "Research Paper Formalization Audit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lee"
    given-names: "Ga Hyun"
version: "0.1.0-pre-release"
date-released: 2026-08-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/leegahuyn/mathlib4/tree/standalone-repo-prep-2026-08-24"
url: "https://github.com/leegahuyn/mathlib4/tree/standalone-repo-prep-2026-08-24"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AI-assisted Lean 4/Mathlib audit of ten mathematical manuscript sketches
  (507 pages), developed using GPT and Codex to identify errors, isolate
  assumptions, construct counterexamples, distinguish conditional from
  unconditional claims, and machine-check formalizable cores. This metadata
  describes the pre-release packaging branch and does not assert that every
  manuscript statement has been proved.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal mathematics
  - theorem proving
  - formal verification
  - AI-assisted mathematics
